## Reproduce

```sh
MNEME_EMBED_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small go run ./cmd/bench -dataset locomo -path bench/data/locomo10.json -k 5 -strategy additive \
  -model google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite -answer-model google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite -judge-model google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite -rerank -multiquery 3
```

